# MSU-TCTO Student Voting System - Project Overview

## 🗳️ Project Description
This is a Next.js 15.3.3 student voting system for Mindanao State University – Tawi-Tawi College of Technology and Oceanography. The system supports both SSC (Supreme Student Council) and College-level elections with secure, anonymous voting.

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

### Core Technologies
- **Framework**: Next.js 15.3.3 with App Router
- **Database**: Microsoft SQL Server (MSSQL)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 with shadcn/ui components
- **Authentication**: Cookie-based session management
- **Charts**: Recharts for data visualization
- **PDF Generation**: jsPDF for vote receipts

### Key File Structure
- **Main Layout**: [app/layout.js](mdc:app/layout.js) - Root layout with Geist fonts
- **Database Connection**: [lib/db.js](mdc:lib/db.js) - MSSQL connection configuration
- **Authentication Middleware**: [middleware.js](mdc:middleware.js) - Route protection for /admin and /voter
- **Package Configuration**: [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Dependencies and scripts

### Supported Colleges
- CAS (College of Arts and Sciences)
- CIAS (College of Islamic and Arabic Studies)
- COED (College of Education)
- COF (College of Fisheries)
- IICT (Institute of Information and Communication Technology)
- IOES (Institute of Oceanography and Environmental Sciences)
- SSC (Supreme Student Council)

## 🔐 Security Features
- Cookie-based authentication
- Route protection middleware
- Anonymous voting system
- Digital vote receipts for verification
- Audit logging capabilities

## 📊 Key Features
- Real-time election results and statistics
- Candidate profile management with photos
- Party-based and individual voting options
- Turnout tracking and analytics
- Export functionality (PDF, Excel)
- Live election status monitoring
